About skill slots for wizards:

30-level character has 29 skill slots to use.

 From unskilled to basic and basic to skilled  cost 1 slot each.
 From skilled to expert costs 2 slots.

		Start		Max		Cost

Attack		basic		expert		3
Healing		unskilled	skilled		2
Divination	unskilled	expert		4
Enchantment	basic		skilled		1
Clerical	unskilled	skilled		2
Escape		unskilled	expert		4
Matter		unskilled	expert		4

Total						20

Leaves 9 skill slots for weapons; 3 for dagger and 6 for whatever you 
fancy. Or if you want to look it the other way: one can be level 24 
wizard with maxed spell skills and maxed dagger.

